{"title": "Precious metals prices fluctuate amid dollar and rate hike concerns", "summary": "The prices of gold and silver have been affected by the recent breach of key support levels, with both metals experiencing a negative trend. The US Federal Reserve's decision to ease interest rates has also impacted the market. Investors are advised to monitor the situation closely.", "summary_points": ["Precious metals prices have fluctuated due to the recent breach of key support levels for gold and silver.", "The US Federal Reserve's decision to ease interest rates has affected the market, with investors taking a wait-and-see approach.", "Gold and silver prices are expected to remain weak until resistance levels are taken out.", "Investors should monitor the situation closely due to the ongoing concerns about rate hikes and dollar fluctuations.", "The impact of the recent economic data on the market is still being assessed."], "title_hi": "सोना और चांदी की कीमतें ब्रेक आउट के बाद नकारात्मक रुझान दिख रही हैं", "summary_hi": "ब्रेक आउट के बाद सोना और चांदी की कीमतें नकारात्मक रुझान दिख रही हैं। अमेरिकी फेडरल रिज़र्व की रेट हाइक नीति में बदलाव ने भी बाजार पर प्रभाव डाला है। निवेशकों को इस स्थिति की निगरानी करनी चाहिए।", "summary_points_hi": ["सोना और चांदी की कीमतें ब्रेक आउट के बाद नकारात्मक रुझान दिख रही हैं।", "अमेरिकी फेडरल रिज़र्व की रेट हाइक नीति में बदलाव ने भी बाजार पर प्रभाव डाला है।", "सोना और चांदी की कीमतें अभी तक रिस्टेंस लेवल्स को नहीं लेने तक कम रह सकती हैं।", "निवेशकों को इस स्थिति की निगरानी करनी चाहिए क्योंकि रेट हाइक और डॉलर प्रभाव पर जारी है।", "हाल ही में आर्थिक डेटा के प्रभाव पर बाजार की प्रतिक्रिया अभी भी देखने को मिल रही है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the impact of the US Federal Reserve's decision on the market, while highlighting the need for investors to monitor the situation closely. They also note that gold and silver prices are expected to remain weak until resistance levels are taken out.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a fluctuation in precious metals prices due to dollar and rate hike concerns, without taking a clear stance on either side. They focus on providing factual information about the market trends.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the negative impact of the US Federal Reserve's decision on the economy and the precious metals market, while highlighting the potential benefits of lower interest rates."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी सूत्रों द्वारा यह कहा जाता है कि अमेरिकी फेडरल रिज़र्व की नीति में बदलाव बाजार पर प्रभाव डाल रहा है, और निवेशकों को इस स्थिति की निगरानी करनी चाहिए। वे यह भी बताते हैं कि सोना और चांदी की कीमतें अभी तक रिस्टेंस लेवल्स को नहीं लेने तक कम रह सकती हैं।"}, "topic": "Economy", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/jp3i6b/article71185747.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/iStock-506120376.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNU2RfT3d3S1kxUElSNEc1OGN3ZG9BVHVzVVdNa2tqbThPbjN3YmNtMW1IeWluU2RWQTJtMHQweUI4cWZqNzZpTXNkam9nSlgxWl80YlhYNlVEaWI1ZHhrbFA0VUNic05uclk2OUhRZDgyU3hlWjRya0xJdWxVM0E4akVJMnJ6SUhwYXpSbURleUt2WGZRSFlwTGF6QW5VOGRrN184T19qSkpwajB6a1JIcllTOHU?oc=5", "headline": "Stocks mostly rise as beaten-down tech stocks enjoy bounce"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/markets/gold-silver-hammered/article71185754.ece", "headline": "Gold, silver hammered"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/gold-silver-rate-today-live-updates-18k-22-carat-24k-gold-price-10g-silver-cost-per-kg-mcx-comex-etf-stock-precious-metal-gold-prediction-city-wise-cost-latest-gold-news/liveblog/132205915.cms", "headline": "Precious metals rate today: Gol